{"ref":"BDB, נְבוּאָה","hw":"נְבוּאָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נְבוּאָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. prophecy</strong> (late: earlier syn. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָזוֹן</span>);—<br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  specific and genuine <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.8\">2 Ch 15:8</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  false <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:12\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.12\">Ne 6:12</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  prophetic writing <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־נְבוּאַת אֲחִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 9:29\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.9.29\">2 Ch 9:29</a>.","next":"BDB, נְבִיאָה","prev":"BDB, נָבָא"}